the biggest problem is when you ask it to design it completely - what usually happens is that it gives you the info which you cant verify this way learning never happens - so it is always 
that you should ask the any AI assitance model to give you the entire context that will burden you - first you need to get the overall clarity of end to end process on a high level even if you 
